FieldError.description:
The validation message, sliding open when the field turns invalid. With no block it shows the field's message (server `error:` or the browser's); `match: :value_missing` (any ValidityState key) shows the block's text only for that failure.

  FieldError()
  FieldError(match: :type_mismatch) { "That doesn't look like an email address" }

Fieldset.description:
Groups related fields under a legend; `disabled: true` disables every control inside.

  Fieldset do
    FieldsetLegend { "Shipping address" }
    Field { FieldLabel { "Street" }; Input() }
  end
